{"version":1,"content":"<p>【石墨烯貼片 ✅】液金已經 Out 了 !! 現在外國玩家開始轉玩「石墨烯貼片」，Reddit 有玩家分享了他的改裝實驗，將原廠配備的液態金屬散熱介質移除，改為使用石墨烯（Graphene）貼片。</p><p>結果顯示，此舉不僅成功解決了處理器過熱降頻（Thermal Throttling）的問題，更讓運算效能顯著提升達 35%。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:39:16.044030+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:35:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T14:17:34.193566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:37:40.485592+00:00","content_hash":"7b66d728d6202b8542cd4dca05ce6e6c6078b3853ed1c58dee62269399b5d3dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}